Highlight wrapped terminal links within each physical row.

Link previews carry inclusive buffer coordinates that can span several rows.
Use the tail of the first row, complete middle rows, and the head of the final
row instead of repeating the endpoint columns on every row. Skip an empty
final row left after trimming a trailing colon. Single-row and command-history
highlights retain their geometry and decoration lifecycle.

